{
    "title": "YoYa: Doll Avatar Maker",
    "description": "Welcome to \"YoYa: Doll Avatar Maker\". Here you will be a stylist and help dolls prepare for her big show. \r\n\r\nChoose various clothes and accessories\ud83d\udc57 to create the perfect look\ud83d\udc8d for any occasion, providing girls with a wonderful and unique dressing experience! With different makeup styles\ud83d\udc84, elegant and sparkling necklaces and bracelets\ud83d\udc8e, and unique hairstyles made up of various trendy colors\ud83d\udc87\u200d\u2640\ufe0f, combined with your ingenuity\ud83d\udc85 and Yoya dolls' unique wallpapers and stickers\ud83c\udf1f, you can create your own doll princess!\ud83d\udc78 \r\n\r\nThis game trip will tell you that from elegant ball gowns to avant-garde streetwear, you will have infinite possibilities.\r\n\r\n[Our features]\r\n\ud83d\udc57 Create unlimited possibilities with a massive collection of fashion items in American street style, cyberpunk, and princess style.\r\n\ud83d\udc57 Choose a cute pet and your favorite background to create a sweet photo for doll girls!\r\n\ud83d\udc57 Choose your favorite bubble to generate your own words and express your thoughts loudly!\r\n\ud83d\udc57 Show off your design skills as a doll fashion designer!\r\n\r\n[Our gameplay]\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Choose from a massive collection of fashion items to create your own doll girl with your own style!\r\n\ud83d\udc8eExperience the most popular clothing, exquisite makeup, and dazzling accessories!\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Blind box gameplay! Randomly drop mysterious fashion eye makeup, blush, lipstick, nail polish, and hairstyles!\r\n \ud83d\udc8eShare with friends and create cute and noble doll princesses together!\r\n\r\n[Share Dressing]\r\n\ud83c\udf38 When you complete a complete doll dress-up, you can click the \"Share\" button to share it with your good friends and share this fantastic doll game journey with them. You can also save it to your device and record this beautiful memory for future viewing.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to &quot;YoYa: Doll Avatar Maker&quot;. Here you will be a stylist and help dolls prepare for her big show. <br><br>Choose various clothes and accessories\ud83d\udc57 to create the perfect look\ud83d\udc8d for any occasion, providing girls with a wonderful and unique dressing experience! With different makeup styles\ud83d\udc84, elegant and sparkling necklaces and bracelets\ud83d\udc8e, and unique hairstyles made up of various trendy colors\ud83d\udc87\u200d\u2640\ufe0f, combined with your ingenuity\ud83d\udc85 and Yoya dolls&#39; unique wallpapers and stickers\ud83c\udf1f, you can create your own doll princess!\ud83d\udc78 <br><br>This game trip will tell you that from elegant ball gowns to avant-garde streetwear, you will have infinite possibilities.<br><br>[Our features]<br>\ud83d\udc57 Create unlimited possibilities with a massive collection of fashion items in American street style, cyberpunk, and princess style.<br>\ud83d\udc57 Choose a cute pet and your favorite background to create a sweet photo for doll girls!<br>\ud83d\udc57 Choose your favorite bubble to generate your own words and express your thoughts loudly!<br>\ud83d\udc57 Show off your design skills as a doll fashion designer!<br><br>[Our gameplay]<br>\ud83d\udc8e Choose from a massive collection of fashion items to create your own doll girl with your own style!<br>\ud83d\udc8eExperience the most popular clothing, exquisite makeup, and dazzling accessories!<br>\ud83d\udc8e Blind box gameplay! Randomly drop mysterious fashion eye makeup, blush, lipstick, nail polish, and hairstyles!<br> \ud83d\udc8eShare with friends and create cute and noble doll princesses together!<br><br>[Share Dressing]<br>\ud83c\udf38 When you complete a complete doll dress-up, you can click the &quot;Share&quot; button to share it with your good friends and share this fantastic doll game journey with them. You can also save it to your device and record this beautiful memory for future viewing.",
